Bert SCSI controller ROMs
=========================

1983 includes two controller ROM images for the Z5380-based MSX SCSI
interface documented at:

  https://hackaday.io/project/205465-scsi-interface-for-msx-computers

The ROM images are included with permission from the author, Bert
Hoogenboom. Copyright remains with the author.

  BertSCSI-v1-D0h-D7h.ROM  original D0h-D7h controller revision
  BertSCSI-v2-30h-37h.ROM  30h-37h controller revision (1983 default)

The v1/v2 names above identify the controller I/O revision and are not the
firmware's internal version banner. Select the matching ROM and Controller
I/O base in Extensions > MSX SCSI, or pass both --scsi-rom and --scsi-port.
Using the wrong pair prevents firmware disk I/O.

